        {
            "title": "A股個別發展  滬股高開後轉跌",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A股開升後個別發展，滬股轉跌，深股及創板續升。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">滬綜指開升6點或0.17%，報3,482點，較早時跌1點或0.04%，報3,475點。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">深成指開升37點或0.37%，報10,121點，較早時升59點或0.61%，報10,144。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">滬深300開升9點或0.23%，報3,909，較早時跌3點或0.09%，報3,896。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">創業板指數開升13點或0.59%，報2,202，現升24點或1%，報2,212。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17272316-a%e8%82%a1%e5%80%8b%e5%88%a5%e7%99%bc%e5%b1%95-%e6%bb%ac%e8%82%a1%e9%ab%98%e9%96%8b%e5%be%8c%e8%bd%89%e8%b7%8c",
